  lines:
  - speaker: 1
    text: "I\u2019m sorry, pilgrim, but I won\u2019t be able to let you pass without
      a crossing permit from our church."
  - speaker: 0
    text: How am I supposed to get one?
  - speaker: 1
    text: With luck, someone in town could help you. But until then, this gate will
      remain closed.
